+// Added by oboete (ui/work-view/patches/0009-mappings-of-the-work-on-screen.patch, #1124): the minute timer's mapping
+// of the work on screen, its clock-made labels moved, stands for no save and no read, on the screen too; a model of
+// new content still does.
